{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02869",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 7.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Doctor, your next patient is here. I've done the basics, I'll read them out in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.14,
      "end_seconds": 11.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Thank you. Right, hello, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.2,
      "end_seconds": 20.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "Oh, hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.71,
      "end_seconds": 25.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 26.97,
      "end_seconds": 35.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "Let me think, um, it's aching bones, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 37.4,
      "end_seconds": 49.86,
      "duration_seconds": 12.46,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse 84, weight 76 kilos, blood pressure 111 over 68, respiratory rate 15, SpO2 98 percent on room air, temp 36.6 degrees, height 169 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.41,
      "end_seconds": 59.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Thanks. Alright, can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.63,
      "end_seconds": 63.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Yeah, around a week, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 65.09,
      "end_seconds": 69.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Hm, you know, I'd say more like two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.48,
      "end_seconds": 75.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly one to two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.97,
      "end_seconds": 78.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.54,
      "end_seconds": 82.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.88,
      "end_seconds": 89.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Uh, you know, about a four out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.12,
      "end_seconds": 92.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.13,
      "end_seconds": 106.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.97,
      "text": "Actually, um, when it starts I tend to get constipation as well. Erm, um, the constipation? That's been for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.25,
      "end_seconds": 109.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Any being thirsty as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.88,
      "end_seconds": 111.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.4,
      "end_seconds": 116.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.98,
      "end_seconds": 122.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.03,
      "end_seconds": 127.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Have you been passing kidney stones?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.98,
      "end_seconds": 133.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.64,
      "end_seconds": 139.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Okay, any weight loss, low mood or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.12,
      "end_seconds": 144.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.03,
      "end_seconds": 148.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Has there been any fractures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.21,
      "end_seconds": 150.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "No. No fractures."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.63,
      "end_seconds": 156.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.51,
      "end_seconds": 162.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.69,
      "end_seconds": 167.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.08,
      "end_seconds": 170.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.29,
      "end_seconds": 176.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Alright, any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.83,
      "end_seconds": 186.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy. My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.18,
      "end_seconds": 191.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Alright, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 192.56,
      "end_seconds": 197.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Yeah, it's Eltroxin, every morning for my thyroid, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.28,
      "end_seconds": 201.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 202.74,
      "end_seconds": 214.48,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "It's 100 micrograms. Um, he is on aspirin, once a day for my heart, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.72,
      "end_seconds": 217.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 218.78,
      "end_seconds": 225.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "It's 75 milligrams. He takes carvedilol, 6.25 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.44,
      "end_seconds": 233.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Ah, I had spironolactone at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.36,
      "end_seconds": 236.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.37,
      "end_seconds": 243.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.24,
      "end_seconds": 248.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.19,
      "end_seconds": 262.03,
      "duration_seconds": 12.84,
      "text": "I've, I've had high blood pressure, yes. I've got an underactive thyroid. Heart disease, for two years. Heart failure, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.18,
      "end_seconds": 271.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure and an underactive thyroid in your file as well. How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.13,
      "end_seconds": 276.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.39,
      "end_seconds": 279.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.24,
      "end_seconds": 286.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.71,
      "end_seconds": 291.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.63,
      "end_seconds": 297.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.58,
      "end_seconds": 308.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.21,
      "end_seconds": 324.07,
      "duration_seconds": 13.86,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.46,
      "end_seconds": 329.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.34,
      "end_seconds": 332.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.27,
      "end_seconds": 345.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Your examination is normal and there is no tenderness over the bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.09,
      "end_seconds": 351.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.89,
      "end_seconds": 377.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with possible raised calcium from an overactive parathyroid at this stage. I'd also keep vitamin D excess in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.46,
      "end_seconds": 381.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.07,
      "end_seconds": 393.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible raised calcium from an overactive parathyroid, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.39,
      "end_seconds": 410.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "We should do a bone density scan for possible hyperparathyroidism. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.65,
      "end_seconds": 414.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 415.3,
      "end_seconds": 416.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}